                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "啵♪……\n这段，是她带我摘油橄榄。\n油橄榄……不太好吃。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006101_141951654_content",
